    "transcript": {
        "duration": 43.16999816894531,
        "text": "Cloud code without a code bill. Via one file edit, you can run cloud code right now without paying for cloud models. A stealth model called OX Alpha just appeared on OpenRouter at 0 dollars per million tokens, both input and output. And by pointing cloud code at OpenRouter API key, you can run the whole harness on it for free. One person burned through 61 million tokens in a single day of testing and paid about 13 cents. The catch? It's from an anonymous provider called Stealth. So check the model terms before feeding it any sensitive information. And it does not work in cloud code desktop apps since that forces cloud models. OpenRouter lists 500 plus models and plenty of others are free too. If you want to set up steps, just comment stealth and I'll send it to you.",
